(text "CONNECTORS. Fabrication package prepared; not ordered..\\nJ_PWR, J_CONTACT and J_PERM are 3.5 mm screw terminals. J_REED, J_SENSE and J_NMEA are JST XH.\\nPins inside one housing are not joined, except J_REED pins 2 and 4, which are both REED_RET so each cable has its own return wire." (at 20 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "f4899ac2-3854-4c88-b7de-7cbf1854313f"))
