(text "J_NMEA is the PCB header, not a Micro-C. Pigtail:\\n1 GND_CAN to NET-C. 2 CAN_L to NET-L. 3 shield, capacitor to GND_CAN only.\\n4 CAN_H to NET-H. 5 NET-S is open. Do not land the red wire. This board does not take backbone power.\\nD_R and D_G are GPIO-driven, 680 ohm, from 3.3 V. D_PWR is on +3V3 and has no GPIO. The blue LED is removed.\\nR_SWLINK and R_IGNLINK are 0 ohm. Coil current still has to pass the external switch, the ignition contact and Q_SERIES.\\nRelay contacts are in parallel with the existing controls. Unplugging J_CONTACT leaves those controls in place.\\nJ_SENSE pin 3 is unused so the two returns are not on adjacent pins." (at 230 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "1aabfe0f-9920-41e3-82d0-0ea29790a497"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
